WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.503
CITransNet takes three inputs: the bidding profile,
bidder-contexts,

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:07.086
and item-contexts.

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:10.669
It embeds contexts with bids into a representation
per bidder-item pair,

00:00:10.749 --> 00:00:14.251
then passes it through transformer interaction
layers that mix a global average with row and column transformers,

00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:17.834
staying permutation-equivariant.

00:00:17.914 --> 00:00:21.417
A final layer outputs allocations and payments,

00:00:21.497 --> 00:00:25.000
with zero-regret enforced during training.
